Web source (THE spec):
  web/src/features/dashboard/widgets/shared/WidgetGaugeHero.tsx
  A pure-presentational primitive: a RadialGauge (size compact 70 / standard 100)
  + an optional centred stats row (label / value [+unit]) rendered only when
