apps/windows/TeslaSync.App.Tests/TeslaSync.App.Tests.csproj was committed at HEAD
in a merge=union-corrupted state: multiple <Project> roots (lines 1, 1429, 1463)
plus stranded comment prose as bare #text under <Project>.
